e-completeness"],"criteria":["project.symbol-reference-completeness"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.5562,"drop_reason":"novelty","evidence":["Plan Files list names only `src/rebar/reconciler/_ref_lock.py` for the `_read_blob_bytes` change.","`src/rebar/reconciler/last_pass.py:168: raw = ref_lock._read_blob_bytes(repo_root, LAST_PASS_REF, oid)` — a cross-file caller inheriting the widened budget, not mentioned in the plan."],"finding":"The plan's affected-file inventory for the `_read_blob_bytes` timeout change omits `last_pass._read_record` (`src/rebar/reconciler/last_pass.py:168`), which calls `_read_blob_bytes` and thus silently inherits the 5s->30s payload-read budget. The plan's Files section lists only `_ref_lock.py`, yet a grep for `_read_blob_bytes` shows this cross-file consumer; it is not acknowledged, so the behavior-change surface is under-enumerated.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f99dd4fe2223fe4be","impact":0.55,"is_primary":null,"location":"Files section: \"src/rebar/reconciler/_ref_lock.py — _read_blob_bytes timeouts.\" and AC: \"_read_blob_bytes passes _REMOTE_TIMEOUT_SECS to both cat-file blob reads\"","norm_id":"ncd47bcd5d8215a20","priority":0.3438,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["last_pass._read_record (last_pass.py:168) reads the LAST_PASS_REF payload blob via _read_blob_bytes; in a blob:none clone its payload read now also uses the 30s remote budget — an intended-or-not behavior change on a consumer the plan never names or tests."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.625,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no",